  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"255\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"255\">Join the Manuka Natural Affiliate Program – Earn with a Brand You Can Believe In</strong></p><p data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"263\">Hello,</p><p data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"485\">We’d love to invite you to become an affiliate partner with <a data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"376\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" href=\"https://www.manukanatural.com\"><strong data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"344\">Manuka Natural</strong></a> — a trusted New Zealand brand with over 25 years of success in the global natural health and skincare space.</p><p data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"825\">At Manuka Natural, we offer a premium range of <strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"604\">natural skincare remedies, beauty creams, and wellness supplements</strong>, powered by the unique healing properties of <strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"691\">Manuka honey and Manuka essential oil</strong> — ingredients found only in New Zealand and backed by scientific research for their powerful antimicrobial and skin-soothing effects.</p><p data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"858\">Our bestselling range includes:</p><ul data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"1158\"><li data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"952\"><p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"952\">Treatments for <strong data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"926\">acne, eczema, ringworm, seborrheic dermatitis,</strong> and <strong data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"952\">fungal infections</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1054\"><p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1054\"><strong data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"983\">Anti-aging beauty creams</strong> featuring Manuka Honey and Bee Venom to reduce wrinkles and fine lines</p></li><li data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1114\"><p data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1114\"><strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1082\">Natural joint support</strong> supplements for people and pets</p></li><li data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1158\"><p data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1158\"><strong data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1133\">Bee propolis</strong> to support immune health</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1507\">We’re proud of our loyal customer base — with many returning over 40 times — and we’ve recently upgraded to Shopify with a smooth, user-friendly shopping experience. Our <strong data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1367\">affiliate program (via UpPromote)</strong> is perfect for health, beauty, and wellness content creators, bloggers, and influencers who want to promote products they truly believe in.</p><p data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1563\"><strong data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1563\">Here’s what you get as a Manuka Natural affiliate:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1802\"><li data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1606\"><p data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1606\"><strong data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1606\">10% commission on all referred sales</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1670\"><p data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1670\"><strong data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1670\">Reliable monthly payouts via PayPal or other arrangements</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1747\"><p data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1747\">Access to <strong data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1716\">high-converting product pages</strong> (2.7% current conversion rate)</p></li><li data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1802\"><p data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1802\">440+ glowing customer reviews and worldwide shipping</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1966\">If you're passionate about natural health and beauty and want to promote authentic, science-backed products that deliver results — we’d love to have you on board.</p><p data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2063\">Have questions? I’m always happy to chat. Just email me directly at <strong data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2062\"><a data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2060\" class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\">info@manukanatural.com</a></strong>.</p><p data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2118\">Warm regards,<br data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2081\"><strong data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2096\">Bill Gluyas</strong><br data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2099\">CEO, Manuka Natural</p></div>",
